<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission not examining compromise EMU plan.</title>
<headline>EU Commission not examining compromise EMU plan.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is not examining any compromise plan that might delay entry into economic and monetary union (EMU), a Commission spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said there would be no pre-judging of membership in a single currency and that the decision of which countries were in would be taken in early 1998.</p>
</text>
